{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00372",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 4.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Good morning. I hope the wait wasn't too long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.4,
      "end_seconds": 7.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Thanks. Sorry, I'm a little early."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.75,
      "end_seconds": 14.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.48,
      "end_seconds": 20.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. Did you take the bus in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.9,
      "end_seconds": 23.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I drove. The roads were quiet today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.47,
      "end_seconds": 25.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 26.42,
      "end_seconds": 30.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Doctor, it's an itchy rash. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.13,
      "end_seconds": 33.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Right, how long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.21,
      "end_seconds": 38.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "It's been going on for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.91,
      "end_seconds": 43.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Right, and what do you do to cope with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.84,
      "end_seconds": 46.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Moisturiser helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.31,
      "end_seconds": 52.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 52.58,
      "end_seconds": 58.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.07,
      "end_seconds": 61.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.7,
      "end_seconds": 65.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Oh, and dry, scaly patches. Had that since last night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.76,
      "end_seconds": 73.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.9,
      "end_seconds": 86.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "It settles a little with moisturiser. A seven out of ten, I suppose. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.54,
      "end_seconds": 92.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Right, have you had an itchy rash before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.85,
      "end_seconds": 97.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.08,
      "end_seconds": 100.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Any oozing or joint pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.35,
      "end_seconds": 109.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "No, no oozing, no joint pain. I did have redness at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.67,
      "end_seconds": 111.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.14,
      "end_seconds": 113.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "No. No fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 113.83,
      "end_seconds": 118.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Actually, uh, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.63,
      "end_seconds": 125.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "No, you know, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.53,
      "end_seconds": 140.48,
      "duration_seconds": 9.95,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any similar rash in family members, breathing trouble or new soap or detergent at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.93,
      "end_seconds": 152.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "I haven't had similar rash in family members, breathing trouble or new soap or detergent, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.56,
      "end_seconds": 155.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.92,
      "end_seconds": 157.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 158.41,
      "end_seconds": 169.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.7,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temperature 36.8, pulse is 78 beats a minute, BP is 115 over 78, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, respiratory rate 15."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.14,
      "end_seconds": 175.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Alright, good, thank you. Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.82,
      "end_seconds": 180.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Eczema, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.33,
      "end_seconds": 183.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.82,
      "end_seconds": 188.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I've had asthma for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.28,
      "end_seconds": 190.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.69,
      "end_seconds": 211.61,
      "duration_seconds": 20.92,
      "text": "Heart disease, for nearly five years. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I've had an irregular heartbeat for about ten years now. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.97,
      "end_seconds": 227.33,
      "duration_seconds": 15.36,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known eczema. We'll keep that in mind today. Right, so that's your known asthma. We'll keep that in mind today. Do you have any known allergies at all? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.6,
      "end_seconds": 231.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.74,
      "end_seconds": 235.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.17,
      "end_seconds": 236.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.79,
      "end_seconds": 249.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.49,
      "end_seconds": 253.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.72,
      "end_seconds": 256.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.53,
      "end_seconds": 265.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. It's aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 267.06,
      "end_seconds": 271.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 37.5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.66,
      "end_seconds": 274.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.53,
      "end_seconds": 283.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "No, I left it at home. I take apixaban, 5 milligrams, maybe, twice a day for the heart rhythm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.26,
      "end_seconds": 287.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.18,
      "end_seconds": 291.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.7,
      "end_seconds": 294.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.99,
      "end_seconds": 307.31,
      "duration_seconds": 11.32,
      "text": "Not at the moment, um, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.8,
      "end_seconds": 313.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.47,
      "end_seconds": 315.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.75,
      "end_seconds": 319.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.2,
      "end_seconds": 329.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No signs of infection, no crusting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.85,
      "end_seconds": 333.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.95,
      "end_seconds": 356.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "There are dry red patches in the creases of both elbows with scratch marks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.84,
      "end_seconds": 383.12,
      "duration_seconds": 22.28,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Putting it all together, it fits best with an eczema flare-up. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. I'd also keep contact dermatitis in mind. A fungal infection is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.38,
      "end_seconds": 393.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had an itchy rash for about three months, and no oozing or breathing trouble."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.76,
      "end_seconds": 396.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.87,
      "end_seconds": 407.95,
      "duration_seconds": 10.08,
      "text": "I'll start you on cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night, for one week. That should help with itching. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 408.35,
      "end_seconds": 410.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.34,
      "end_seconds": 440.03,
      "duration_seconds": 27.69,
      "text": "Let's use mometasone cream, once a day, for two weeks. It's for eczema. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Moisturise right after a bath, thick creams are better than lotions, and use a mild soap. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 441.19,
      "end_seconds": 448.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 448.62,
      "end_seconds": 449.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 451.26,
      "end_seconds": 456.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 458.35,
      "end_seconds": 460.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 461.74,
      "end_seconds": 464.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 465.37,
      "end_seconds": 468.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 469.64,
      "end_seconds": 473.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 474.73,
      "end_seconds": 483.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "So, I take the cetirizine, 10 milligrams, at night and take the mometasone cream, once a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 486.7,
      "end_seconds": 491.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, we're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 492.69,
      "end_seconds": 496.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0074",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 499.08,
      "end_seconds": 499.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}